{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2026-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1778889600, "end_date": 1779580799, "month_true_total": 1291, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:30:05 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "226245250", "author": {"steamid": "76561199343684124", "personaname": "没打赢就要挨草哦", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199343684124/", "num_games_owned": 42, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 38362, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1399, "playtime_at_review": 31629, "last_played": 1787988117, "avatar": "3709c6cc1e650f51bc7c8bc4cf873da82a736a22"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "傻福箭头\r\n各种恶性bug不修，利好玩家的bug隔天就修复完成\r\n还天天惦记着你那B平衡呢？tm啥都不会在那瞎几把做，咋地是我们花钱买你们的游戏还是游戏里的小怪给你们花钱啊？他妈不为玩家体验着想倒过来为对面小怪在乎游戏体验？\r\n♥♥", "timestamp_created": 1779561640, "timestamp_updated": 1779561640, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226243498", "author": {"steamid": "76561199351110108", "personaname": "不定向性矢志不渝", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199351110108/", "num_games_owned": 49, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 20495, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 715, "playtime_at_review": 15280, "last_played": 1788009811, "avatar": "8df3fbb9717a9433d4c709138700c25228676cb9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "箭头到底会不会做游戏用脚做的平衡\r\n还有啥比bug天天不修到底在干嘛", "timestamp_created": 1779560145, "timestamp_updated": 1779560145, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226235709", "author": {"steamid": "76561198872959284", "personaname": "迪克五代&丁真", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198872959284/", "num_games_owned": 44, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 35105, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 168, "playtime_at_review": 31726, "last_played": 1787509168, "avatar": "978931ff2d774c665a91b9fa83c8a6a8666dca91"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "说句实话，这游戏从首发玩到现在，真的不会腻。但是箭头一开始真的想教玩家怎么去玩游戏，太傻比了，各种恶心玩家（什么武器多人玩就削什么），活活把日活从七八十万干到只有五六万。现在的评价也是差评居多，还是沙贝箭头天天只会加强怪物削弱玩家的武力值。大哥这是爽游啊，你让玩家在里面狼狈折磨，谁还愿意玩啊。老玩家不是不想帮萌新（有时候一拖三都会翻车...心累），但是你游戏做的萌没能力赢怪物，萌新也会退游啊。希望开发者善待玩家，记住你们是一款爽游！！！", "timestamp_created": 1779553778, "timestamp_updated": 1779553778, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31965", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 8940HX with Radeon Graphics        ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti Laptop GPU", "vram_size": 11944}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226230628", "author": {"steamid": "76561199234246149", "personaname": "daoketa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199234246149/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 8045, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 526, "playtime_at_review": 6712, "last_played": 1787826514, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "为什么会卡输入法啊，只是想正常游戏啊", "timestamp_created": 1779549644, "timestamp_updated": 1779549644, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received